shots from the Ski-E-O Demo![\/h3][p]Stunning mountain views, your amazing resorts, or moments worth remembering- we want to see it.[\/p][p][b]How to enter:[\/b][\/p][list][*][p]Share your original screenshots (JPG or PNG) in this channel: [url=\"https:\/\/discord.com\/channels\/1476002317626114111\/1476649382681252054\"]https:\/\/discord.com\/channels\/1476002317626114111\/1476649382681252054[\/url][\/p][\/*][*][p]Entries must be your own work and taken in the Ski-E-O demo.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][b]\ud83c\udfc6 Prizes: 3 winners will each receive a $20 Steam Gift Card and a special Discord vanity role![\/b][\/p][p]\ud83d\udcc5 October 19-27, 2026[\/p][p]Share your favourite moments and show the community what you've been building on the mountain. I can't wait to see your shots! \ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f[\/p][hr][\/hr][h2][b]\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Mini Event #1: Find the Unexpected Guest![\/b][\/h2][p]Something has snuck into the [b]SKI-E-O Demo![\/b] If you can find it, prove it![\/p][p][b]Rules:[\/b][\/p][list][*][p]Share your screenshot of the \"Guest\" (JPG or PNG) in this: [url=\"https:\/\/discord.com\/channels\/1476002317626114111\/1560082346001043536\"]https:\/\/discord.com\/channels\/1476002317626114111\/1560082346001043536[\/url][\/p][\/*][*][p]Entries must be your own work and taken in the SKI-E-O Demo.[\/p][\/*][*][p]You will not be able to see what you're looking for, but we will react with a \u2705 if you got it right, and you will [b]win the role: \"Resort Overseer\".[\/b][\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\ud83d\udcc5 October 16-27, 2026[\/p][p][\/p][hr][\/hr][h2]If you're enjoying the demo, please don't forget to leave a review![\/h2][h3]It really does help![\/h3][p][dynamiclink href=\"https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/app\/5012760\/SkiEO_Ski_Resort_Tycoon_Demo\/\"][\/dynamiclink][b]And you can wishlist Ski-E-O! Ski Resort Tycoon here:[\/b][\/p][p][dynamiclink href=\"https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/app\/4493130\/SkiEO_Ski_Resort_Tycoon\/\"][\/dynamiclink][\