						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/909c8945c1ebe50fcb5c52c1ab3a08f6.avif?t=1792696424" width=1527 height=362 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Build the Legendary Ski Resort you've always dreamed of.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >You start with just a ticket office and a bit of cash. Transform an empty mountain into a Legendary Resort in this management tycoon game from an industry veteran and passionate skier.  </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/2935a4d110c25cb1d738d5a109779fcd.poster.avif?t=1792696424" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/2935a4d110c25cb1d738d5a109779fcd.webm?t=1792696424" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/2935a4d110c25cb1d738d5a109779fcd.mp4?t=1792696424" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/fd1b475e40d7d187d5f33a0b5aeb12b9.avif?t=1792696424" width=1527 height=362 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >No rigid grid system. Paint trails directly onto terrain built from real LiDAR data from around the world.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >You need a variety of trails for all types of skiers: green circles for beginners, black diamonds for the brave.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Build cozy ski villages with lodges, restaurants, après bars, shopping, and more!</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/3a208b598ac657e9fe6126c238397813.poster.avif?t=1792696424" width=780 height=350 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/3a208b598ac657e9fe6126c238397813.webm?t=1792696424" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/3a208b598ac657e9fe6126c238397813.mp4?t=1792696424" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/c9b4e7e618ec8ecb380e23a4d67aa8b9.avif?t=1792696424" width=1527 height=362 /></span>See to the needs of thousands of guests as they arrive at your resort - everyone wants something different, so make sure to keep them happy. Some are there to chill, others are there to shred. <br><i>Watch a Jerry wipe out on an expert trail he had no business entering! And make sure you have enough Ski Patrol hired to help him out after you’re done laughing.</i></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/778d1d2420ffd8a2a1ff383152a45630.avif?t=1792696424" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras_big/778d1d2420ffd8a2a1ff383152a45630.avif?t=1792696424 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Not everyone came to ski! Place buildings that satisfy a variety of guests, from waffle stands to spas, warming huts to five-star hotels.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/596ae5859cd4be3172204d50cf60b22a.poster.avif?t=1792696424" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/596ae5859cd4be3172204d50cf60b22a.webm?t=1792696424" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/596ae5859cd4be3172204d50cf60b22a.mp4?t=1792696424" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/20b57475dfda6fc863bea425cb75fba8.avif?t=1792696424" width=1527 height=362 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Every peak is built from real-world elevation data: the actual ridgelines, fall lines, and the weather that comes with them.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/7ad0e71ebcabc755de5681800bb79b3c.poster.avif?t=1792696424" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/7ad0e71ebcabc755de5681800bb79b3c.webm?t=1792696424" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/7ad0e71ebcabc755de5681800bb79b3c.mp4?t=1792696424" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Snow falls, settles, melts, and drifts on a GPU-simulated snowpack, and skiers carve real grooves into the powder as they go.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >An El Niño year turns the storms warm and wet. Snow turns to rain and wipes out your trails.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Drought means running snowblowers around the clock just to stay open.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >A big dump buries your buildings before the lifts even spin.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >A cool summer keeps your peaks soft and fluffy for the next season.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >The East is cold and icy, with little natural snow. Run your snowmakers to keep your guests from wiping out.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Utah serves up light, consistent powder, the most forgiving place to build.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >The Sierras flip between massive blizzards that bury your mountains and stubborn dry spells that melt what's there.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >The Colorado Rockies pair dependable snowfall with brutal, high-altitude cold that tests how warm you keep your guests.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >And the Pacific Northwest never stops dumping deep, heavy snow, keeping your groomers working overtime.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/04164be54e0d30d13cab66f433cee3c4.avif?t=1792696424" width=1455 height=813 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Play across every major ski region on Earth - from the five US regions to Japan, the Alps, the Andes, Canada, Australia and New Zealand, and China.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras/c5cef194a442f2bceaa3e9beb51ad1f0.avif?t=1792696424" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4493130/extras_big/c5cef194a442f2bceaa3e9beb51ad1f0.avif?t=1792696424 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>						</div>
					</div>
				
				
				
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse sys_req" style="max-height: 300px;">
