							<ul>
								<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (version 2004 or later)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600 (6-core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 / GTX 1660 / AMD RX 6600 / Intel Arc A750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD strongly recommended. Requires a GPU supporting DirectX 12 Shader Model 6.6 with 64-bit atomics. Not supported: Windows on ARM (Qualcomm Snapdragon laptops).</li></ul>							</ul>
						</div>
																<div class="game_area_sys_req_rightCol">
							<ul>
								<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400 / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X (6-core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060 (DLSS) / AMD RX 6600 / 6650 XT (FSR)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD strongly recommended. Requires a GPU supporting DirectX 12 Shader Model 6.6 with 64-bit atomics. Not supported: Windows on ARM (Qualcomm Snapdragon laptops).</li></ul>							</ul>
						</div>
